      "text": "极秘的圆桌会议",
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2ec04d3a8e07d704ffeda737bff94a6215c3062555e706e354e295feb9fde",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "極秘の円卓会議",
      "text": "极秘的圆桌会议",
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2ec04d3a8e07d704ffeda737bff94a6215c3062555e706e354e295feb9fde",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_029ass_2_1_2_029_12:1_2_029_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ケーキがもたらした出会い",
      "text": "蛋糕带来的相遇",
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f293bfae675dd8eafc6506f8de0b8fe63cc2ac740715143b388e9bfa825a86",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "一番食べたいケーキは",
      "text": "最想吃的蛋糕是",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78ad83f2e90b50e6215305c70e71d7b3c30288178d431e1c822ef18ef4138e3",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "一番食べたいケーキは",
      "text": "最想吃的蛋糕是",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78ad83f2e90b50e6215305c70e71d7b3c30288178d431e1c822ef18ef4138e3",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_030mak_2_1_2_030_12:1_2_030_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "一歩踏み出して",
      "text": "迈出一步",
      "source_hash": "sha256:751b626775941ec0c5a2214966e78cf5491300d87f09ea69395badf7ba0f8b88",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "負けられない勝負",
      "text": "无法服输的对局",
      "source_hash": "sha256:564b773fd15b2d6865a17b1fdff90046eed96b79ac1950204efea82e83b1c8df",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ヒミツのお誕生日大作戦！",
      "text": "秘密的生日大作战！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:f695ebdff3ce63cb2cc9efc2184cbb8f47e3d57c6b0304a08f7ca5c188c54706",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_02_1_2_032_02:1_2_032_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ヒミツのお誕生日大作戦！",
      "text": "秘密的生日大作战！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:f695ebdff3ce63cb2cc9efc2184cbb8f47e3d57c6b0304a08f7ca5c188c54706",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_032nao_2_1_2_032_12:1_2_032_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "涙は努力の証",
      "text": "眼泪是努力的证明",
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a763f49c3848a8561a26b9e20843f22ed692a93d5e4991df40250d721f11b2a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_01_1_2_033_01:1_2_033_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "主役にはぜったいヒミツ！",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "主役にはぜったいヒミツ！",
      "text": "对主角绝对要保密！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af5106c0bf39a56facddd58d08ff99122ac717dc421f58c673ae51577c9e049",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_033shr_2_1_2_033_12:1_2_033_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "憧れのアイドル",
      "text": "憧憬的偶像",
      "source_hash": "sha256:2620b13db0d0dd9dcd4e7f3bf2832af3124e81813014fe3f98f4bad86fa0370c",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "『わくわく』と『そわそわ』",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "『わくわく』と『そわそわ』",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_034kan_2_1_2_034_12:1_2_034_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "いつも通りで、いつもよりも、楽しい夜",
      "text": "一如往常、又胜过往常的快乐夜晚",
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9e420cecfc139e01a1d218c63a01c75234efdb0173fcd7854c2b53a755f2d2",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "いつも通りで、いつもよりも、楽しい夜",
      "text": "一如往常、又胜过往常的快乐夜晚",
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9e420cecfc139e01a1d218c63a01c75234efdb0173fcd7854c2b53a755f2d2",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_035mco_2_1_2_035_12:1_2_035_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "日々Science",
      "text": "日常Science",
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eadfad861df16fbd6958113a38374caabb85a5b21104b8d285ea60303569d35",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_037jir_01_1_2_037_01:1_2_037_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "大切な想いを込めて",
      "text": "倾注珍贵的心意",
      "source_hash": "sha256:356015c1a1f762c80ceea62c4c93a3b68cb2b3696c3e41d2acc427a8d0a991a2",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_01_1_2_038_01:1_2_038_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "誰がための誕生日パーティ",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "誰がための誕生日パーティ",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "持ちつ持たれつ",
      "text": "互帮互助",
      "source_hash": "sha256:d69d5247cdbf26c44304be2be1febabb5184475549b7154ac00efb85f3b5f0ae",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "オレ様のモーニングルーティン",
      "text": "本大爷的早间日常",
      "source_hash": "sha256:08bc50ec9ffed1557b1033079ee04920b0ee82e40fcbfa2efa43d5cc09f3f943",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "災い転じて、笑顔となす",
      "text": "转祸为福，喜笑颜开",
      "source_hash": "sha256:426f356f054065acb4df47888b31832fcb2cb1e2a162121c40cbb83c0a3d514e",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_041ryo_01_1_2_041_01:1_2_041_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ネズミが招いたお宝",
      "text": "老鼠招来的宝物",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e397ebfc929a7eb1c58bd999f9bca61a2782da70b76c3d5e7211489cc40f5b62",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_042dai_01_1_2_042_01:1_2_042_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "緑深まる山野にて",
      "text": "绿意浓郁的山野间",
      "source_hash": "sha256:80b1a777068ada7a3c19d16a4d0ba7dec24821493eace815e937e3af5582be80",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_01_1_2_043_01:1_2_043_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "聖地巡礼は彼の為に",
      "text": "圣地巡礼为他而行",
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ee6b78cea05754105c4eb7f98f36173254ddf6770876b4ae0aef866e840bef",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_043kaz_02_1_2_043_02:1_2_043_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "聖地巡礼は彼の為に",
      "text": "圣地巡礼为他而行",
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ee6b78cea05754105c4eb7f98f36173254ddf6770876b4ae0aef866e840bef",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_043kaz_2_1_2_043_12:1_2_043_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "事務所掃除は心の掃除",
      "text": "打扫事务所即是净化心灵",
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc5ab2860749e809b21fdb33e38295011ca06fda3a1563b4a774bc8b61465d51",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ささやかな食事会",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_02_1_2_044_02:1_2_044_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ささやかな食事会",
      "text": "小小聚餐会",
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7bbbdba55f0c89ce72df577b95c9d1879b35482e9266522bd421e3ccc14e2",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_044ame_2_1_2_044_12:1_2_044_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "本当も、嘘も",
      "text": "真心也好，谎言也罢",
      "source_hash": "sha256:4babd33c01a21883fbcf77c542587f10e083554771d9c160a9e1fca76e48561e",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_01_1_2_045_01:1_2_045_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "特別な日のサプライズ",
      "text": "特殊日子的惊喜",
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac26541c69ae6de1d5543be844e9b235ea46b121559c2d6052ff5d11ee29fb47",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "特別な日のサプライズ",
      "text": "特殊日子的惊喜",
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac26541c69ae6de1d5543be844e9b235ea46b121559c2d6052ff5d11ee29fb47",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_045sor_2_1_2_045_12:1_2_045_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "あなたにお見せしたいのです",
      "text": "想要展示给您看",
      "source_hash": "sha256:73f0d0f8e4f9e7a668c0435ebdab4ee13453a112b751b5cd9ec2a826d6131cec",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_01_1_2_046_01:1_2_046_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "1人で見る海、皆で見る海",
      "text": "独自看的大海，大家看的大海",
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c21ebca70d5a3ea97dfc734da81b54bf8a9d1cff0d5af206b53acbbdeabbfab",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "1人で見る海、皆で見る海",
      "text": "独自一人的海，与大家同看的海",
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c21ebca70d5a3ea97dfc734da81b54bf8a9d1cff0d5af206b53acbbdeabbfab",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "今一番熱いこと",
      "text": "如今最热衷的事",
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c7639ff47369e43196b725e424eb93e57f2397e5b05aed906fc6794a4599141",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "放課後シアタールーム",
      "text": "放学后的家庭影院",
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e784afc64d81f91dcfc52cf7e2551015d0d50515c1abbecfe6e51d562d98d41",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_02_1_2_047_02:1_2_047_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "放課後シアタールーム",
      "text": "放学后的家庭影院",
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e784afc64d81f91dcfc52cf7e2551015d0d50515c1abbecfe6e51d562d98d41",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_12:1_2_047_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "僕を作りなおす言葉",
      "text": "重塑自我的话语",
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ceb0510d3ad95ed4bf233b7cf535f90f1a5a954f7cfd2236fe71f8370032d54",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "『好き』の気持ち",
      "text": "“喜欢”的心情",
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d1770077de7e819c5f462fd455a762a0621242cca300b2c1f0fa56c5f9fda25",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "新たな夢の開演",
      "text": "新梦想开演",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26d45b17879569fe05d3c4706ccceec909eda28b67b5c7facc3579051762916",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_00:1_4_001_00_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "新たなる三つの輝きと共に！",
      "text": "与崭新的三道光芒一同！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f36418148a51328db0391690c15d518106a0ad0bc5812a3b317355e6e935f2a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_01:1_4_001_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "初めての仕事",
      "text": "第一次工作",
      "source_hash": "sha256:853ab75db1aa9ca0bab7149e58931d08d9b5147e1891df42476286653a77ab77",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "好きに真っすぐ！",
      "text": "笔直奔向所爱！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7ae441463d049a37403364f1446cfd5dac7cda5599fd4a20f65167f0c379540",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "自分らしく、自分たちらしく",
      "text": "像自己，像我们自己",
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ce89806573cb24de3f996803fe878444be7e26477427c571a2e074482365b77",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_04:1_4_001_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "トリニティ・アタック！！！",
      "text": "三位一体冲锋！！！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c67e11954dfa74ae7e384b569daf374c71a3547aa7361a22f14f81bfd92f788",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_05:1_4_001_05_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "3人一緒にえいえい、おー！",
      "text": "三人一起，嘿——嘿——哦！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:272650ba424179d7145b3dadee2a454d33286000660ba93c38dc8199803e8b35",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "出来ることは、諦めないこと",
      "text": "能做的事，就是绝不轻言放弃",
      "source_hash": "sha256:280f16b759b617c893a8f51317ee795f77fe176f343e908549922fb721d82982",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "熱く冷静に燃え上がる男たち",
      "text": "炽热而冷静燃烧的男儿们",
      "source_hash": "sha256:d519c569d2b5bb0ab48ab57449795439d7bb61fe58c284439890d170cfb4d52a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "過去と未来を照らす星",
      "text": "照亮过去与未来的繁星",
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3c50f43da19ed6afccf1fa2c7e28698998671da671a34a5751845978fc7f75",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "黒い影",
      "text": "黑影",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f8c280c6831976f523502274a16ecba33a98216bbeaede18ee8a1da3e4c76a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_00:1_4_002_00_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "始動、『男極ッ！アイドルリーグ』",
      "text": "始动，“男极！偶像联赛”",
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ebc0681aba0211eefef91186f36befcf0dc75c9d1d25efe8ab1d2be857af7",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "目指せ、Jupiterイチのモテ男！",
      "text": "目标是Jupiter第一的万人迷！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:822d8b5e7f03a03461a896adf145e0dcfc718c8dbff4056ee53ad2158ed5d9dc",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "希望のVICTORY",
      "text": "希望的VICTORY",
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa01898a2146aab8856566a71ff6fa3b2459143bde0079b352a97419ebd844e4",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "シング・ア・ソング・フォー",
      "text": "Sing a song for",
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1b26bd5c92a44ccc73a2f6710c888e04b746174483db6b045d7f64679e05d4",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "時をこえる邂逅",
      "text": "跨越时空的邂逅",
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e41aaa392468150a87f4fb1a762831433ecf88b977c83c554c737bb7a26c74",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "弱気も強気も一緒に行こう！",
      "text": "软弱与逞强都要同行！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:214fdcccde98d0a62775f2877532a682dd0c57a52cd14611dc528e8ff823d3ea",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "驚け、轟け、都築圭！",
      "text": "惊叹吧，轰鸣吧，都筑圭！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d8ec8f2041182d2e99687966e020e406e1545363995c5453b128e7766498a0",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "不運もラッキー！",
      "text": "厄运也是幸运！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aab900f87083af6090ac47214011cd8a1d82ffb4eacbe60c1790dbf58616830",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "あやしい男極、あやしいライブ",
      "text": "可疑的男极，可疑的LIVE",
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33eb7b03c77f1cfbd72959ecc6fdc0e817ebcae36d273fcc7c02c4943a684cf",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_09:1_4_002_09_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "俺たちが、『男極〇〇〇〇』だ！！",
      "text": "我们就是“男极〇〇〇〇”！！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7981daf14509f8a21abdf9c1a1630f1ef6b98838327916825c25c8fe70150a",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "祝いの心を音に乗せて",
      "text": "将祝福之意寄托于乐音",
      "source_hash": "sha256:956c8307ea3b3f3f1af6a5e6c25a4cd78b858cde7e63f4bc62dd2b495108bc10",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_007kei_2_1_2_007_12:1_2_007_12:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "唯一無二の誕生日会",
      "text": "独一无二的生日会",
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8ad83f6f14ff0500887cebf408c5501f576e595c2cc53a486af2c57f6ba031",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_016sei_2_1_2_016_12:1_2_016_12:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "甘い匂いと努力と友情！",
      "text": "甜甜的香气、努力与友情！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "新たなるメンバー？",
      "text": "新成员？",
      "source_hash": "sha256:068a5a7167425520111a475f93994527c79038e9d37bcce89d1ac99fe116b597",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:5_03_000_22:5_03_000_22_a:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "ゲームの世界への招待状",
      "text": "通往游戏世界的邀请函",
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ec85bb6c9ac1e259519d281054d0f9cf4dd6c3eb09ab95db1547ccc0979a0ef",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:5_05_001_00_5_05_001_00:5_05_001_00:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "星座と占いとカオマンガイ",
      "text": "星座与占卜与海南鸡饭",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8baf09896c9f991b3db8296f9d5cfe2375fea7e10b1b5d88dfbb9054f30a563",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:5_05_002_00_5_05_002_00:5_05_002_00:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "年末合同ライブに向けて",
      "text": "面向岁末联合演唱会",
      "source_hash": "sha256:22ac77b28700a0b79526eb2a61f66b550d0afff145435b2cb7256d756afc837e",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:5_05_003_00_5_05_003_00:5_05_003_00:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "アーティスティックに魅力を見せて",
      "text": "展现艺术般的魅力",
      "source_hash": "sha256:e428c26371df1a9154221c78775aad55d8e33deb4ac6c9d5a9b96c51a9c47c12",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:5_05_004_00_5_05_004_00:5_05_004_00:cmd-000000:title:000"
    },
    {
      "source": "新たなる『挑戦』！",
      "text": "崭新的“挑战”！",
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bd2a207c86d7e6e489ed09e99fc5978dd4cd11b95565cc399565951ba3c77c1",
      "unit_id": "story-text:v1:5_06_000_22_5_06_000_22:5_06_000_22:cmd-000000:title:000"
    }
  ],
